zy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: green\"><b>Good</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sweet%20Smelling%20Bait\"><img alt=\"Sweet Smelling Bait\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sweet_Smelling_Bait_75e43e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Nightmare%20Blade\"><img alt=\"Nightmare Blade\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Nightmare_Blade_5a1570.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Demonbone Amulet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demonbone_Amulet_6db9bf.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Boots%20of%20Haste\"><img alt=\"Boots of Haste\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Boots_of_Haste_d4312e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Robe\"><img alt=\"Red Robe\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Red_Robe_a1c902.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.20<br/>July 2, 2008<br/>Summer Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>Be very careful when coming to this hunting place, because there is a large number of <a href=\"#/wiki/Grim%20Reaper\">Grim Reapers</a> and other creatures. A single Reaper can combo over 1500 damage per turn, if you are a <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">knight</a> lower than level 150 it may be very dangerous. Mages and <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">paladins</a> should get a blocker before going there.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Route\">Route</span></h2>\n<p>To get in there you must go to <a href=\"#/wiki/Drefia\">Drefia</a>. Near the centre of the mountain wall, there is a little ruin that has a <a href=\"#/wiki/Zombie\">Zombie</a> inside of it. You will need <a href=\"#/wiki/Levitate\">Levitate</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Parcel\">Parcels</a> to get there. Go down the stairs where you will face a few floors of minor creatures until you enter a room with wide sandstone stairs. Down these stairs are the <b>Grim Reaper Dungeons</b>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h2>\n<p>Use <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bomb\">Fire Bombs</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Wall\">Magic Walls</a> to keep the <a href=\"#/wiki/Grim%20Reaper\">Grim Reapers</a> away from shooters and healers. Mages and <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">paladins</a> can use these runes to make creatures run around the fields.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>On the way to the Dungeon</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" 